
**Availability and Reliability**
* Write a Java program to calculate service availability from total observation time and downtime intervals.
* Implement a utility that calculates the percentage of successful requests over a rolling time window.
* Write a program to calculate end-to-end availability for services arranged in series and parallel, given their individual availability values.
* Implement a sliding-window error-rate calculator for an API.
* Design a Java component that records service failures and recovery times to calculate mean time to recovery (MTTR).

