* Write a Java fault-injection wrapper that can simulate latency, exceptions, and intermittent dependency failures in a test environment.
* Implement a configurable dependency simulator that produces failures at a specified probability.
* Write an automated resilience test that verifies an API continues operating when a non-critical dependency becomes unavailable.
